---
description:
  A title position that is not one of the six is ignored with a warning. The config value
  "middle" warns FLOWCHART_CONFIG_IGNORED, the subgraph's own "sideways" warns
  FLOWCHART_TITLE_POSITION, and both titles are drawn at the top in the middle
  (mermaid-js/mermaid#2977).
config:
  flowchart:
    subGraphTitlePosition: middle
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph one [First]
        a --> b
    end
    subgraph two [Second]
        c --> d
    end
    two@{ titlePosition: sideways }
